                "shiji-region"
              ],
              "speakerLabel": "张骞",
              "evidenceType": "modern-adaptation"
            },
            {
              "lineId": "arrival-migration",
              "text": "月氏原先住在敦煌、祁连一带。被匈奴击败后，才远迁，经过大宛，来到西边。",
              "sourceIds": [
                "shiji-region"
              ],
              "speakerLabel": "当地协助者",
              "evidenceType": "modern-adaptation"
            },
            {
              "lineId": "arrival-daxia-relations",
              "text": "月氏西迁后击败大夏，使大夏臣属。大夏在月氏以南，两地有关联，却不是同一个地方。",
