                "shiji-disposition"
              ],
              "speakerLabel": "当地协助者",
              "evidenceType": "modern-adaptation"
            },
            {
              "lineId": "arrival-5",
              "text": "先把汉廷的来意说清楚。走了这么久，我仍要完成这项使命。",
